note Allen-first chrome. No top navigation bar. Classic documents remain complete readable pages.
note sc_begin stores metadata; sc_route emits head and opens main; sc_end finishes the document.
note Core sc_extrahead owns registry-aware JSONLD, hreflang, citations and route assets.
note Native root and Allen scripts come from Core; consent artifacts remain PopupOnce-owned.
global sctitle uchar 2048
global scdesc uchar 8192
global sclens ulong 2
global scstate uchar 2
global scarea ulong 1
